        <div class="container">
            <div class="product-details section-gap">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-lg-8">
                        <div class="product-gallery clearfix">
                            <div class="product-gallery-arrow"></div>
                            <div class="gallery-slider-warp">
                                <div class="product-gallery-slider">
                                    <div class="single-gallery-itam" data-thumb="assets/img/shop/details-thumb-01.avif">
                                        <a href="assets/img/shop/product-details-01.avif" class="img-popup"><img loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="600" height="584" src="assets/img/shop/product-details-01.avif" srcset="assets/img/shop/product-details-01.avif 600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 600px" alt="University Bags product photo 1"></a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="single-gallery-itam" data-thumb="assets/img/shop/details-thumb-02.avif">
                                        <a href="assets/img/shop/product-details-02.avif" class="img-popup"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="584" src="assets/img/shop/product-details-02.avif" srcset="assets/img/shop/product-details-02.avif 600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 600px" alt="University Bags product photo 2"></a>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="single-gallery-itam" data-thumb="assets/img/shop/details-thumb-03.avif">
                                        <a href="assets/img/shop/product-details-03.avif" class="img-popup"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="584" src="assets/img/shop/product-details-03.avif" srcset="assets/img/shop/product-details-03.avif 600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 600px" alt="University Bags product photo 3"></a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-4">
                        <div class="product-summary">
                            <h3 class="product-name">University Bags</h3>
                            <ul class="rating">
                                <li> <i class="fas fa-star"></i> </li>
                                <li> <i class="fas fa-star"></i> </li>
                                <li> <i class="fas fa-star"></i> </li>
                                <li> <i class="fas fa-star"></i> </li>
                                <li> <i class="fas fa-star-half"></i> </li>
                            </ul>
                            <span class="price">$89.00</span>
                            <div class="short-description">
                                <p>
                                    This engagement follows our standard delivery path: assess your current state,
                                    agree a sequenced roadmap, build the highest-value changes first, and hand
                                    over clean operations. You know what you get, when, and what it costs —
                                    before we start.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Deliverables include a current-state assessment, a prioritized roadmap with
                                    owners and timelines, implementation support, and an operating handover with
                                    runbooks. Questions about fit for your scope? <a href="contact.html">Contact
                                    us</a> and we will give you a direct answer.
                                </p>
                            </div>
