                                            What you get, in plain terms. <strong>Assess:</strong> we review your
                                            systems, spend, and delivery bottlenecks and agree measurable outcomes.
                                            <strong>Roadmap:</strong> a sequenced plan ordered by value, with owners
                                            and timelines. <strong>Build:</strong> we ship the highest-value
                                            changes with your team, not around them. <strong>Operate:</strong>
                                            handover with runbooks and steady-state support so results hold.
                                        </p>
                                        <p>
                                            Representative engagement pattern — scope, timelines, and outcomes vary
                                            by client. If you want specifics for your situation, <a href="contact.html">contact
                                            us</a> and we will scope it honestly, including telling you when we are
                                            not the right fit.
                                        </p>
